<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>COON WITH A SPOON PRODUCTIONS</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-color: #f4f1ea;
            --ink-color: #111111;
            --border-color: #111111;
            --highlight: #b52b2b;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--bg-color);
            color: var(--ink-color);
            font-family: "Courier New", Courier, monospace;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 20px;
            line-height: 1.4;
        }

        .newspaper-container {
            max-width: 1000px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            border: 4px solid var(--border-color);
            padding: 20px;
            background-color: #fdfbf7;
            box-shadow: 8px 8px 0px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);
        }

        /* Header / Masthead */
        header {
            text-align: center;
            border-bottom: 3px double var(--border-color);
            padding-bottom: 15px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .masthead-info {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            font-weight: bold;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            padding-bottom: 5px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 2.8rem;
            margin: 10px 0;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            font-weight: 900;
        }

        .tagline {
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 3px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: var(--highlight);
        }

        /* Layout Grid */
        .grid-layout {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr;
            gap: 20px;
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .grid-layout {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
        }

        section {
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            padding: 15px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            background: #ffffff;
        }

        h2 {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border-color);
            margin-top: 0;
            padding-bottom: 5px;
            background-color: var(--ink-color);
            color: var(--bg-color);
            padding-left: 5px;
        }

        /* Articles & Headlines */
        .lead-story h3 {
            font-size: 1.6rem;
            margin: 5px 0 10px 0;
            line-height: 1.1;
        }

        .story-meta {
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: var(--highlight);
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        p {
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            text-align: justify;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .secondary-stories ul {
            list-style-type: none;
            padding: 0;
            margin: 0;
        }

        .secondary-stories li {
            border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--border-color);
            padding: 10px 0;
        }

        .secondary-stories li:last-child {
            border-bottom: none;
        }

        .secondary-stories h4 {
            margin: 0 0 5px 0;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
        }

        .page-tag {
            float: right;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            background: var(--ink-color);
            color: white;
            padding: 1px 5px;
        }

        /* Index / Directory sidebar */
        .sidebar-box {
            border: 2px solid var(--border-color);
            padding: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            background: #f4f1ea;
        }

        .sidebar-box h3 {
            margin-top: 0;
            font-size: 1rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            padding-bottom: 5px;
        }

        .district-list {
            list-style: square;
            padding-left: 20px;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            margin: 0;
        }

        .district-list li {
            margin-bottom: 6px;
        }

        .district-list a {
            color: var(--ink-color);
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .district-list a:hover {
            background: var(--ink-color);
            color: white;
        }

        footer {
            text-align: center;
            border-top: 2px solid var(--border-color);
            margin-top: 20px;
            padding-top: 10px;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="newspaper-container">
    
    <!-- Masthead -->
    <header>
        <div class="masthead-info">
            <span>Multimedia Archive</span>
            <span>Studio 616 Base</span>
            <span>No Algorithms &bull; Pure Sandbox</span>
        </div>
        <h1>Coon With A Spoon Productions</h1>
        <div class="tagline">The Multiverse Hub &bull; Setting: Stone Jug</div>
    </header>

    <!-- Main Grid Layout -->
    <div class="grid-layout">
        
        <!-- Left Column: Main Content / Pillars -->
        <div>
            <!-- Lead Story -->
            <section class="lead-story">
                <div class="story-meta">Project Pillar &bull; Confessions of a Cereal Killer</div>
                <h3>INSIDE THE BORDERLINES OF STONE JUG: INDUSTRIAL COLLAPSE & THE RUST-BELT OUTSKIRTS</h3>
                <p>Welcome to Coon With A Spoon Productions. This hub hosts our independent multimedia projects, anchored by the open-world sandbox of Stone Jug. Explore raw social commentary, local histories pulled straight from real asphalt, and district-by-district archives where every door opens.</p>
                <a href="#" style="font-weight: bold; color: var(--ink-color); text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 0.85rem;">[Enter the Archive &rarr;]</a>
            </section>

            <!-- Secondary Stories -->
            <section class="secondary-stories">
                <h2>Multiverse Broadcasts & Pillars</h2>
                <ul>
                    <li>
                        <span class="page-tag">P. 02</span>
                        <h4>Where the Sidewalk's End</h4>
                        <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; margin-bottom:5px;">A conceptual double-album of acoustic grit, flat farmland anthems, and roadside debris.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <span class="page-tag">P. 03</span>
                        <h4>The Crimson Spiral</h4>
                        <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; margin-bottom:5px;">A cursed grimoire and occult narrative artifact operating out of the darker corners of the map.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <span class="page-tag">P. 04</span>
                        <h4>Ashgrove Heights Outpost Notes</h4>
                        <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; margin-bottom:5px;">Current perimeter tracking and local observations from the Hastings outskirts.</p>
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </section>
        </div>

        <!-- Right Column: Navigation / Master Map Index -->
        <div>
            <div class="sidebar-box" style="background: var(--ink-color); color: white;">
                <h3 style="color: white; border-color: white;">STONE JUG MASTER MAP</h3>
                <p style="font-size: 0.8rem; margin-bottom: 10px;">Select a district sector to access local files, lore, and sandbox entry points:</p>
                <ul class="district-list" style="color: #f4f1ea;">
                    <li><a href="#" style="color: white;">SJ/DT: Stone Jug Proper / Downtown</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#" style="color: white;">MPW: Milpond Ward (Nashville Roots)</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#" style="color: white;">CH: Cypress Hollow (Middleville)</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#" style="color: white;">AH: Ashgrove Heights (Hastings)</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#" style="color: white;">BF: Briarville Flats (Farmland)</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#" style="color: white;">LH: Lincoln Heights</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#" style="color: white;">SBD: South Business District</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#" style="color: white;">IP: Industrial Park</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#" style="color: white;">CP: Cherry Pass & Hyman Woods</a></li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="sidebar-box">
                <h3>The Sandbox Rule</h3>
                <p style="font-size: 0.8rem;">Every district is active. Build your stories, trace your routes, and drop your lore into the grid. No corporate gatekeeping.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <footer>
        <p>&copy; Coon With A Spoon Productions / Studio 616. All rights reserved to the underground.</p>
    </footer>

</div>

</body>
</html>
